# Private terms that must never appear in this repository.
#
# Copy this file to `.leak-denylist` (which is gitignored) and list the terms
# that identify your machine, your accounts, or your usage. `tools/lint-leaks.mjs`
# fails when any of them appears in a tracked file.
#
# One term per line. `#` starts a comment. Matching is case-insensitive and
# substring-based, so list the distinctive fragment rather than a whole line.
#
# Example — replace every line below with your own:
#
#   # provider aliases configured in your DSH profile
#   my-proxy-alias
#   my-second-provider
#
#   # model ids you route through them
#   some-vendor-model-name
#
#   # names of the projects you actually work in
#   my-secret-project
#   client-work-repo
#
#   # hosts and paths
#   internal.example.com
#   my-laptop-hostname
